{"Title":"An Act internet access on private ways","BillNumber":"H85","DocketNumber":"HD661","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"DTV1","Name":"David T. Vieira","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/DTV1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-16T12:53:17.087"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"DTV1","Name":"David T. Vieira","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/DTV1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-16T12:53:17.0866667"},{"Id":"DAF1","Name":"Dylan A. Fernandes","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/DAF1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-09T08:41:27.3866667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H85/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Vieira of Falmouth, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 85) of David T. Vieira and Dylan A. Fernandes relative to the installation of internet services for abutting owners on private ways.  Advanced Information Technology, the Internet and Cybersecurity.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1.  Section 5 of chapter 187 of the General Laws, as appearing in the latest Official Edition, is hereby amended by inserting after the word “telephone”, in each location it appears, the following word:- internet.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J33","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J33"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}